unit_type/1677956/c8fec58a-37ac-4880-9617-db11f07e2796.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","categories":["bathroom"],"sizes":{"1024x768":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1677956/c8fec58a-37ac-4880-9617-db11f07e2796.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=768&w=1024","width":1024,"height":768},"2048x1536":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1677956/c8fec58a-37ac-4880-9617-db11f07e2796.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","width":2048,"height":1536},"320x240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1677956/c8fec58a-37ac-4880-9617-db11f07e2796.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1677956/c8fec58a-37ac-4880-9617-db11f07e2796.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1677956/c8fec58a-37ac-4880-9617-db11f07e2796.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}},{"originalLink":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1677956/9e51de1c-7417-41bb-a16f-589183b153e0.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","categories":null,"sizes":{"1024x768":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1677956/9e51de1c-7417-41bb-a16f-589183b153e0.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=768&w=1024","width":1024,"height":768},"2048x1536":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1677956/9e51de1c-7417-41bb-a16f-589183b153e0.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","width":2048,"height":1536},"320x240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1677956/9e51de1c-7417-41bb-a16f-589183b153e0.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1677956/9e51de1c-7417-41bb-a16f-589183b153e0.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1677956/9e51de1c-7417-41bb-a16f-589183b153e0.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Die Wohnung wird für mind. 7 Monate und möbliert angeboten. Der Pauschalmietpreis inkl. Nebenkosten (Heizung, Kalt-/Warmwasser), Strom, Internet und Möblierungszuschlag liegt bei 850 Euro (warm) pro Monat.\n\nBeschreibung\n\nDie 3-Zimmerwohnung befindet sich in Neuberg-Rüdigheim. Die Wohnung ist aufgeteilt in einen großzügigen Wohnbereich, Schlafzimmer, Büro, Küche & Tageslichtbad.\n\nAusstattung\n\n- Wohnfläche: 85 m2 mit 3 Zimmern, Küche, Bad\n- Voll möbliert; modern eingerichtet\n- Wohnbereich: TV, Couch, Esstisch, div. Kleinmöbel\n- Küche: komplette Einbauküche, Kaffeemaschine, Mikrowelle, Geschirr etc.\n- Waschmaschine, Trockner & Spülmaschine\n- Schlafzimmer: Doppelbett 140 x 200 cm, Kleiderschrank\n- Büroraum mit Schreibtisch\n- Tageslichtbad mit Badewanne und Einbaumöbel\n- WLAN-Gastzugang\n- Parkplatzmöglichkeit gibt es direkt vor dem Haus.\n\nLage\n\nNeuberg ist eine attraktive und familienfreundliche Gemeinde im Main-Kinzig-Kreis mit rund 5.300 Einwohnern und liegt eingebettet in das idyllische Ronneburger Hügelland. Die Umgebung ist geprägt von viel Grün, Feldern und Wäldern und bietet einen hohen Freizeit- und Erholungswert.\n\nTrotz der naturnahen Lage verfügt Neuberg über eine sehr gute Anbindung an den Ballungsraum Frankfurt Rhein/Main. Die Städte Hanau (ca. 10 km) und Langenselbold (ca. 2 km) sind schnell erreichbar. Der direkte Autobahnanschluss an die A45 (Richtung Gießen/Würzburg) befindet sich am Ortsrand und ermöglicht eine zügige Verbindung in alle Richtungen.\n\nVor Ort finden sich gute Einkaufsmöglichkeiten für den täglichen Bedarf, Kindertagesstätten, eine öffentliche Bücherei sowie verschiedene Freizeit- und Sportangebote. Über 30 Vereine sorgen für ein vielfältiges kulturelles und sportliches Leben. Schulen, weiterführende Einkaufsmöglichkeiten und medizinische Versorgung sind in den umliegenden Städten vorhanden.\n\nNeuberg vereint ruhiges, naturnahes Wohnen mit urbaner Nähe und ist damit ein idealer Wohnort für Pendler, Familien und Ruhesuchende gleichermaßen.\n\n---------------------------\n\nThe apartment is offered furnished for a minimum term of 7 months. The all-inclusive monthly rent is € 850, including utilities (heating, cold and hot water), electricity, internet, and a furnishing surcharge.\n\nDescription\n\nThis 3-room apartment is located in Neuberg-Rüdigheim. The apartment features a well-designed layout with a spacious living area, bedroom, home office, kitchen, and a daylight bathroom.\n\nFeatures & Furnishings\n\n- Living space: approx. 85 m2 with 3 rooms, kitchen, and bathroom\n- Fully furnished with modern interior design\n- Living area: TV, sofa, dining table, and various small furnishings\n- Kitchen: fully fitted kitchen, coffee machine, microwave, dishes, and kitchen utensils\n- Washing machine, dryer, and dishwasher\n- Bedroom: double bed 140 x 200 cm and wardrobe\n- Office room with desk\n- Daylight bathroom with bathtub and built-in cabinets\n- Guest Wi-Fi access\n- Parking available directly in front of the building\n\nLocation\n\nNeuberg is an attractive and charming municipality with approximately 5,300 residents. Nestled in the scenic Ronneburg hill country, Neuberg offers excellent recreational opportunities while being directly connected to the Frankfurt Rhine-Main metropolitan area.\n\nLocal amenities such as daycare centers (including nursery facilities), a public library, and convenient local shopping options are readily available. More than 30 local clubs and associations offer a wide range of leisure activities.\n\nThe transport connections are excellent: the neighboring town of Langenselbold is approx. 2 km away, Hanau is only 10 km away, and the direct A45 motorway access (towards Giessen/Würzburg) is located at the edge of the town.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"no"},"basement":{"value":"private"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"no"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"shared"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"no"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"no"},"tenantStatus":{"value":"working professionals only"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"85"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":85000,"deposit":150000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"850.00","deposit":"1500.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":6,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":30,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2026-09-01"}],"updated":"2026-08-05T08:53:35Z","__utId__":"ut1677956"}]